  <item>
    <title>117.如何获得ENTJ般的行动力？ENTJ的1800个技能和TA的“拆解”思维</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6acb8403195d838e2af03497</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6acb8403195d838e2af03497</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 11 Oct 2026 21:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>从拆洗家电到木工、水电，</span><br><span>从设计剪辑到写代码、做 App、搭网站，</span><br><span>从运动健身到各类家务... ...</span><br><br><span>王阿姨的技能树，枝繁叶茂，肆意生长。要不是李叔叔提起，王阿姨也没意识到自己已经点出了如此驳杂的技能树。和王阿姨生活了十多年的李叔叔，无数次都想问一个问题：</span></p><p><span>“王阿姨这种 ENTJ，到底是怎么长出这么乱七八糟的技能的？？？”</span></p><p><strong><span>&nbsp;</span></strong></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="40">00:40</a> ENTJ的十八般武艺</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="539">08:59</a> 智能马桶 Deep Clean</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="736">12:16</a> 自制手机的每一个App图标</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1158">19:18</a> 三个教练 三套说辞</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1554">25:54</a> 长痛不如短痛</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1951">32:31</a> 从Photoshop到Adobe全家桶</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2687">44:47</a> 不同人眼中不同的麻烦</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3346">55:46</a> 甚至开始自己码App了</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4646">1:17:26</a> 拆家电和玩游戏都是一种娱乐</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4911">1:21:51</a> 李叔叔的成长经历：为什么不想再逼自己</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5128">1:25:28</a> 有些事只是很烦 但并不难</span></p><p><span>&nbsp;</span></p><p><span>在APPLE PODCAST，SPOTIFY，小宇宙，荔枝播客等多平台同时更新。欢迎订阅+评论留言，或在APPLE PODCAST为我们打分。期待您的评论及反馈。</span></p><p><span>合作请发邮件到：UNCLEL.AND.AUNTIEW@GMAIL.COM</span></p><blockquote><p><span>Op: William King - Bossa Nova by Acoustic Guitar</span></p><p><span>Ed: William King - Gypsy Jazz Guitar</span></p><p><span>文案：王阿姨</span></p><p><span>剪辑/后期：李叔叔</span></p></blockquote><p><strong><br><br></strong></p>]]></description>
