  <item>
    <title>116. 亲密关系中的关心则乱：问题解决了，但TA更生气了？</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6ab9200c195d838e2aeab512</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6ab9200c195d838e2aeab512</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 27 Sep 2026 21:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>不知道大家在亲密关系中是否经历过这样的对话这句话：</span></p><p><strong><span>“我都这么努力帮你解决问题了，你怎么反而更生气了？”</span></strong><span>&nbsp;</span></p><p><span>一个习惯立刻行动，优先解决问题</span></p><p><span>一个对情绪敏感，希望得到理解</span></p><p><span>一个问：为什么我越帮TA越急？</span></p><p><span>一个问：为什么TA努力帮忙，我却更生气了？</span></p><blockquote><p><span>&nbsp;</span><strong><span>情绪，到底是如何影响亲密关系的？</span></strong></p></blockquote><p><strong><span>&nbsp;</span></strong></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="48">00:48</a> 么的感情的男人</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="665">11:05</a> 男性无意识的情绪疏导</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1129">18:49</a> 活了三十年才发现自己看不见情绪</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1334">22:14</a>《关心则乱》</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2200">36:40</a> 处理情绪 VS 付诸行动</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2683">44:43</a> 尊重他人命运</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2843">47:23</a> 问题解决了，情绪还在</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3471">57:51</a> 冷漠与陪伴</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4102">1:08:22</a> 我不开心，但这件事与你无关</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4367">1:12:47</a> 先射箭，再画靶</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4891">1:21:31</a> 表达自我需求，尊重对方选择</span></p><p><span>&nbsp;</span></p><p><span>在APPLE PODCAST，SPOTIFY，小宇宙，荔枝播客等多平台同时更新。欢迎订阅+评论留言，或在APPLE PODCAST为我们打分。期待您的评论及反馈。</span></p><p><span>合作请发邮件到：UNCLEL.AND.AUNTIEW@GMAIL.COM</span></p><blockquote><p><span>Op: William King - Bossa Nova by Acoustic Guitar</span></p><p><span>Ed: William King - Gypsy Jazz Guitar</span></p><p><span>文案：王阿姨</span></p><p><span>剪辑/后期：李叔叔</span></p></blockquote><p></p>]]></description>
