  <item>
    <title>115. 养猫，然后养狗 II</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6aa6915f492687f6aad932c0</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6aa6915f492687f6aad932c0</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 13 Sep 2026 21:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>大约半年前，我们家迎来了一个新成员——小狗Subuta</span><br><span>从每天擦屎擦尿的人狗大战中幸存的我们终于尝到了养狗的甜头：我们家的Subuta从一个小小的邪恶摇粒绒，逐渐变成了一只天使小泰迪。</span></p><p><span>这一期，我们来聊聊在生活中观察到的，与小狗有关的可爱小事。</span></p><p><span>养狗一年后我们越来越觉得，真正需要被训练的，也许不只有狗狗。</span></p><ul><li><p><strong><span>第一期： 养猫，然后养狗 - 渡劫篇 </span></strong><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/69c93384e2c8be3155d12f20" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/69c93384e2c8be3155d12f20"><span>www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com</span></a></p></li><li><p><strong><span>第二期：养狗，养直男，养亲密关系 </span></strong><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6a0093b81b7bd50295de5478" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6a0093b81b7bd50295de5478"><span>www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com</span></a></p></li></ul><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="37">00:37</a> 结束养狗渡劫</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="158">02:38</a> 天使小狗VS邪恶摇粒绒</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="363">06:03</a> 用小狗的热脸贴每一个冷屁股</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="620">10:20</a> 到底谁有分离焦虑，是小狗还是主人？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="961">16:01</a> Learn to be alone</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1310">21:50</a> 成熟的小狗要自己学会听指令</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1736">28:56</a> 论：如何正确进行爱的物理鞭策</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2210">36:50</a> 无论人还是狗，幼年期都需要指引</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2637">43:57</a> 从溺爱到建立规则</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3459">57:39</a>&nbsp;犬种是真的有说法的</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4090">1:08:10</a> 思念爸妈两分钟</span></p><p><span>&nbsp;</span></p><p><span>在APPLE PODCAST，SPOTIFY，小宇宙，荔枝播客等多平台同时更新。欢迎订阅+评论留言，或在APPLE PODCAST为我们打分。期待您的评论及反馈。</span></p><p><span>合作请发邮件到：UNCLEL.AND.AUNTIEW@GMAIL.COM</span></p><blockquote><p><span>Op: William King - Bossa Nova by Acoustic Guitar</span></p><p><span>Ed: William King - Gypsy Jazz Guitar</span></p><p><span>文案：王阿姨</span></p><p><span>剪辑/后期：李叔叔</span></p></blockquote><p><span>&nbsp;</span></p><p><strong><br></strong></p><p><strong><span>&nbsp;</span></strong></p>]]></description>
