    <title>110. 送给低精力的你:不按套路的轻松减肥吧！</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6a4a5f002e335a35a80e6d99</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6a4a5f002e335a35a80e6d99</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 05 Jul 2026 22:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><strong><span>最近一阵子李叔叔和王阿姨刚好都处于刷脂减肥期。</span></strong></p><p><strong><span>高精力的王阿姨体重稳定降低时，低精力的李叔叔却掉秤缓慢。</span></strong></p><p><strong><span>&nbsp;于是乎，这期我们就来聊聊类似李叔叔这类低精力，低行动力人群的减肥策略。</span></strong></p><ul><li><p><strong><span>&nbsp;</span></strong><span>不费力的才是最好的</span></p></li><li><p><span>不是吃的太少 而是大家太瘦</span></p></li><li><p><span>普通上班族如何维持身材？</span></p></li></ul><p><strong><span>让我们把更多的注意力放在个体差异上，把有限的精力投入习惯养成中；</span></strong></p><p><strong><span>付出更小的努力，获得更好的结果。</span></strong></p><p></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="33">00:33</a> 低精力人李叔叔</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="358">05:58</a> 集中性思考 VS 集中性行动</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="790">13:10</a> 不做加法做减法</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1148">19:08</a> “坚持”是反人类的</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1405">23:25</a> 简单的营养学&amp;基础烹饪知识</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2046">34:06</a> 唠五毛的白人饭</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2460">41:00</a> 你不喜欢鲱鱼罐头 为什么我要喜欢酱豆腐？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2833">47:13</a> 在不知不觉中增加活动量</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2991">49:51</a> 互联网上的极端饮食</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3157">52:37</a> 不是吃的太少 而是人家太瘦</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4008">1:06:48</a> 无痛的才是最好的</span></p><p><span>&nbsp;</span></p><p><strong><span>&nbsp;</span></strong><span>在APPLE PODCAST，SPOTIFY，小宇宙，荔枝播客等多平台同时更新。欢迎订阅+评论留言，或在APPLE PODCAST为我们打分。期待您的评论及反馈。</span></p><p><span href=""><span>合作请发邮件到：UNCLEL.AND.AUNTIEW@GMAIL.COM</span></span></p><blockquote><p><span>Op: William King - Bossa Nova by Acoustic Guitar</span></p><p><span>Ed: William King - Gypsy Jazz Guitar</span></p><p><span>文案：王阿姨</span></p><p><span>剪辑/后期：李叔叔</span></p></blockquote><p><strong><br></strong></p><p><strong><span>&nbsp;</span></strong></p>]]></description>
