    <pubDate>Sun, 21 Jun 2026 22:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>去年的上半年，在进行了多次激烈的夫妻吵架后，王阿姨被李叔叔请出了家门，喜提大阪自由生活六个月。</span></p><p><span>&nbsp;由于刚好赶上大阪世博会，各路酒店要么贵要么满，王阿姨不得不一个月换四个住处，开始了他的大阪奇妙冒险。</span></p><p><span>&nbsp;在冒险过程中，王阿姨可能觉得难度太低，还把自己的手指摔骨折，开启了地狱难度。。。 。。。</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FnXHcoQeeySS_h9QQNNiCvbamw9c.jpg"><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="29">00:29</a> 大阪流浪王阿姨</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="321">05:21</a>&nbsp;世博会带来的住宿费疯涨</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="734">12:14</a> 消失的白板</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1179">19:39</a> 昭和古早味破旧民宿</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1896">31:36</a> 手指骨折 正式开启地狱难度</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2272">37:52</a> 骨折的指头 他长歪了</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2485">41:25</a> 甚至还遇上了火警</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2917">48:37</a> 再见 那些帮助过我的破民宿</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3171">52:51</a> 沉默是金</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3326">55:26</a> 号外！“王阿姨的饭”在红书开始更新啦~</span></p><p><strong><span>&nbsp;</span></strong></p><p><span>在APPLE PODCAST，SPOTIFY，小宇宙，荔枝播客等多平台同时更新。欢迎订阅+评论留言，或在APPLE PODCAST为我们打分。期待您的评论及反馈。</span></p><p><span>合作请发邮件到：UNCLEL.AND.AUNTIEW@GMAIL.COM</span></p><blockquote><p><span>Op: William King - Bossa Nova by Acoustic Guitar</span></p><p><span>Ed: William King - Gypsy Jazz Guitar</span></p><p><span>文案：王阿姨</span></p><p><span>剪辑/后期：李叔叔</span></p></blockquote><p></p>]]></description>
