    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>我们两个人送走了年迈老猫，浪了两年，最近养狗了。颇有感触。</span></p><p><span>最初想聊聊“养狗仿佛育儿”这件事；</span></p><p><span>聊着聊着，发现养直男也像是育儿；</span></p><p><span>然后再聊着聊着，感叹夫妻之间不也是在相互养育吗？</span></p><blockquote><p><span>事实上，我们每一个人都在生活中时刻包容着偶尔变成孩童的另一半。</span></p></blockquote><p><span>（注：直男的儿童化几率较高）</span></p><p><span>（注：再高也没有小狗高）</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="40">00:40</a> 训狗大师王阿姨 训人大师李叔叔</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="476">07:56</a> 教育理念分歧</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="858">14:18</a> 训狗就像教小孩</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1304">21:44</a> 人机王阿姨</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1723">28:43</a> 谁上心谁失眠</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2124">35:24</a> 从教育孩子到夫妻矛盾</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3041">50:41</a> 男人如狗</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3556">59:16</a> 直男的非主动性舒压</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3725">1:02:05</a> 随口一说也是锋利的</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4012">1:06:52</a> 养育另一半</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4460">1:14:20</a> 超缓慢开机</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4858">1:20:58</a> 目的地的景色固然美好，也不要忘记在旅途中看看窗外哦~</span></p><p><span>&nbsp;</span></p><p><span>在APPLE PODCAST，SPOTIFY，小宇宙，荔枝播客等多平台同时更新。欢迎订阅+评论留言，或在APPLE PODCAST为我们打分。期待您的评论及反馈。</span></p><p><span href=""><span>合作请发邮件到：UNCLEL.AND.AUNTIEW@GMAIL.COM</span></span></p><blockquote><p><span>Op: William King - Bossa Nova by Acoustic Guitar</span></p><p><span>Ed: William King - Gypsy Jazz Guitar</span></p><p><span>文案：王阿姨</span></p><p><span>剪辑/后期：李叔叔</span></p></blockquote><p><br></p><p><span>&nbsp;</span></p>]]></description>
