  <item>
    <title>106. 减肥第一阶段，我们决定先什么都不改变</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/69ee00c01d989496e78cd940</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">69ee00c01d989496e78cd940</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 26 Apr 2026 22:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><strong><span>李叔叔突然要减肥了。</span></strong></p><p><span>要求也很明确：不能挨饿、要吃甜食、绝不运动，但想瘦。</span><br><span>于是王阿姨接下了这个高难度订单。</span></p><p><span>让我们一起来看看一个普通路过懒癌在减肥初期都做了些什么。</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="30">00:30</a> 从来不减肥的李叔叔要减肥了</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="122">02:02</a> 任何一顿饭后面总要有个甜的</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="404">06:44</a> 李叔叔减肥最大的两个难题</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="538">08:58</a> 难搞又好搞的甲方</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="790">13:10</a> 改变自己之前先了解自己</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1084">18:04</a> 日均1900大卡</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1416">23:36</a> 如何召唤巨龙</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1623">27:03</a> 慢速但稳定的掉秤</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2119">35:19</a> 第一件事：诚实的记录</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2631">43:51</a> 鸡扔扔是好文明</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2936">48:56</a> 计量单位：巧克力面包</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3058">50:58</a> 普通素人 轻松减肥</span></p><p></p><p><span>在APPLE PODCAST，SPOTIFY，小宇宙，荔枝播客等多平台同时更新。欢迎订阅+评论留言，或在APPLE PODCAST为我们打分。期待您的评论及反馈。</span></p><p><span href=""><span>合作请发邮件到：UNCLEL.AND.AUNTIEW@GMAIL.COM</span></span></p><blockquote><p><span>Op: William King - Bossa Nova by Acoustic Guitar</span></p><p><span>Ed: William King - Gypsy Jazz Guitar</span></p><p><span>文案：王阿姨</span></p><p><span>剪辑/后期：李叔叔</span></p></blockquote><p><br></p><p><span>&nbsp;</span></p>]]></description>
