  <item>
    <title>104. 养猫，然后养狗 I</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/69c93384e2c8be3155d12f20</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">69c93384e2c8be3155d12f20</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 29 Mar 2026 22:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>最近，家里迎来了一位新成员：一条可爱小狗。</span></p><p><span>区区三公斤的小狗为我们两个20年的资深养猫人带来了太多的狗狗震撼。</span></p><p><span>两个月不到，小狗掌握了诸多技能，学会了定点上厕所，也学会了挑食，学会了见人下菜碟，以及终极技能：粑粑的自产自销。</span></p><p><span>20年+，我们养猫，然后养狗。</span></p><p><span>（下拉看可爱狗狗~）</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="35">00:35</a> 养狗养到掉眼泪</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="248">04:08</a> 父子两条狗</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="511">08:31</a> 一环套一环</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="874">14:34</a> 第二聪明的犬种</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1164">19:24</a> 自产自销</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1567">26:07</a> 挑食问题</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1831">30:31</a> 人训狗狗训人</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2278">37:58</a> 和平静生活说再见</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2773">46:13</a> 十多年的作息不规律被狗治好了</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3341">55:41</a> 24/7零帧起手全自动闯祸机</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3775">1:02:55</a> 养狗哪儿有不疯的</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4376">1:12:56</a> 人的需求≠狗的需求</span></p><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FiMheUZg3N0KZ0mnT4IJEev9RbRG.jpg"></figure><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lj4qWoU6bCyG4Woq7nrLt-KIMYGP.jpg"></figure><p><span>在APPLE PODCAST，SPOTIFY，小宇宙，荔枝播客等多平台同时更新。欢迎订阅+评论留言，或在APPLEPODCAST为我们打分。期待您的评论及反馈。</span></p><p><span>合作请发邮件到：UNCLEL.AND.AUNTIEW@GMAIL.COM</span></p><blockquote><p><span>Op: William King - Bossa Nova by Acoustic Guitar</span></p></blockquote><blockquote><p><span>Ed: William King - Gypsy Jazz Guitar</span></p></blockquote><blockquote><p><span>文案：王阿姨</span></p></blockquote><blockquote><p><span>剪辑/后期：李叔叔</span></p></blockquote>]]></description>
