    <pubDate>Sun, 15 Mar 2026 22:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<ul><span>  </span><li><span>一个平凡普通的中午，王阿姨吃午餐偶遇了来日本比赛的巴西柔术选手。遂获得坐上场边教练椅的一日体验卡。</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>本期轶闻录就和大家唠唠临场观看格斗比赛的震撼，对于体育精神的全新理解；以及最近我们在生活中遇到的二三事~</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="31">00:31</a> 社牛，为生活带来更多乐趣</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="413">06:53</a> 教练席一日体验卡</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="655">10:55</a> “我的对手突然躺下了”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="858">14:18</a> 最后的真龙和最后的熊猫</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1322">22:02</a> 临场感带来的震撼</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1668">27:48</a> 无差别级比赛</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1849">30:49</a> 三语翻译发光发热</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1961">32:41</a> 55kg VS 110kg</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2511">41:51</a> 互惠的社交</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2715">45:15</a> 有端联想：中日韩推拿正骨</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2995">49:55</a> 枯萎的花坛 消失的奶奶</span></p><span></span><p><span>在APPLE PODCAST，SPOTIFY，小宇宙，荔枝播客等多平台同时更新。欢迎订阅+评论留言，或在APPLEPODCAST为我们打分。期待您的评论及反馈。</span></p><span></span><p><span>合作请发邮件到：</span><a href="mailto:UNCLEL.AND.AUNTIEW@GMAIL.COM"><span>UNCLEL.AND.AUNTIEW@GMAIL.COM</span></a></p><span></span><blockquote><span>Op: William King - Bossa Nova by Acoustic Guitar</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>Ed: William King - Gypsy Jazz Guitar</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>文案：王阿姨</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>剪辑/后期：李叔叔</span></blockquote>]]></description>
